and skilled personnel ensure the capability to successfully complete the proposed and future\nefforts entirely in-house.\nSince its inception, Immobileyes has strategically expanded its core capabilities, culminating in the\ndevelopment of HALAR, a versatile platform technology with demonstrated applications across diverse\nsectors, including security, law enforcement, and military. All R&D activities are conducted by a\ndedicated team of engineers and scientists at its Ohio facility. The company’s strategic focus on domestic\nmanufacturing positions Immobileyes to become a leading provider of directed energy hailing and\ndisruption systems for perimeter security applications.\n10. Subcontractors/Consultants: None\n11. Prior, Current, or Pending Support of Similar Proposals or Awards\nThis proposal is not substantially the same as any other proposal that has been funded, is currently being\nfunded, or is pending with another Federal Agency or with any DoD Service or Component.\n12. Identification and Assertion of Restrictions on the Government''s Use, Release, or Disclosure of\nTechnical Data or Computer Software: None"},"history":[],"provenance":{"source":"imported"},"library_eligible":true}]'::jsonb, NULL, 410, 2946, '{}'::jsonb, 'approved', 0.5, 'pending', 0.5, 0, 'upload', 'f5d07400-ac40-491e-9a0e-70b7e76d79f6'::uuid, NULL, NULL, '686842de-ae88-44ac-b724-8e550f079e3e'::uuid, 'tenant', '2026-08-18T22:42:54.318Z'::timestamptz, '2026-08-18T22:42:54.318Z'::timestamptz, 'admin', uid, '[{"blockIds":["b16"],"sourceAtomId":"c4b9486f-79dd-4135-9ad8-3541e505e828"}]'::jsonb, NULL)
