  VALUES ('fa067155-9882-49bd-8f3b-e6bf513fe8dc'::uuid, tid, 'primitive', 'p10 · Significance of Problem and Opportunity
4
Topic: X23.5', 'Significance of Problem and Opportunity
4
Topic: X23.5_CSO 	Proposal Number: FX235-CSO1-0859
“Base-Wide Counter-UAS and Defeat of Drone Surveillance Utilizing Innovative LED-Based Directed Energy System”
 	The consumer drone is over $2.7B annually and expected
to grow to over $21.6B by 2030. 	The cost to purchase
highly capable autonomous systems is dropping.
 	Each of these commercial drones represents a clear and
present threat to the operational security of the Air Force
and Department of Defense.
 	With high-fidelity optical and infrared camera systems
onboard, these commercial drones can be used by
adversaries at any level to conduct intelligence gathering.
 	While counter-UAS and counter-drone technologies are
advancing, drone swarms have circumvented existing
counter-measures time and again.
 	Defeating the sensing and information collection
capabilities of these drones is paramount to defeating them.', '[{"id":"4534a892-0c3d-434e-a18a-21ac21fe5c68","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Significance of Problem and Opportunity\n4\nTopic: X23.5_CSO \tProposal Number: FX235-CSO1-0859\n“Base-Wide Counter-UAS and Defeat of Drone Surveillance Utilizing Innovative LED-Based Directed Energy System”\n \tThe consumer drone is over $2.7B annually and expected\nto grow to over $21.6B by 2030. \tThe cost to purchase\nhighly capable autonomous systems is dropping.\n \tEach of these commercial drones represents a clear and\npresent threat to the operational security of the Air Force\nand Department of Defense.\n \tWith high-fidelity optical and infrared camera systems\nonboard, these commercial drones can be used by\nadversaries at any level to conduct intelligence gathering.\n \tWhile counter-UAS and counter-drone technologies are\nadvancing, drone swarms have circumvented existing\ncounter-measures time and again.\n \tDefeating the sensing and information collection\ncapabilities of these drones is paramount to defeating them."},"history":[],"provenance":{"source":"imported"},"library_eligible":true}]'::jsonb, NULL, 132, 926, '{}'::jsonb, 'approved', 0.5, 'pending', 0.5, 0, 'upload', '31c0c32b-a7c5-47fc-817b-55a3b84f960f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, '686842de-ae88-44ac-b724-8e550f079e3e'::uuid, 'tenant', '2026-08-18T22:42:56.452Z'::timestamptz, '2026-08-18T22:42:56.452Z'::timestamptz, 'admin', uid, '[{"blockIds":["b10"],"sourceAtomId":"61cb1be6-93f1-4af6-9561-8b8fb5b5e554"}]'::jsonb, NULL)
