  VALUES ('28d8fa6e-a73d-47e5-96df-66f93152f4cc'::uuid, tid, 'primitive', 'p11 · Significance of Problem and Opportunity
5
Topic: X23.5', 'Significance of Problem and Opportunity
5
Topic: X23.5_CSO 	Proposal Number: FX235-CSO1-0859
“Base-Wide Counter-UAS and Defeat of Drone Surveillance Utilizing Innovative LED-Based Directed Energy System”
 	The Department of Defense has over 800 active duty bases
worldwide. 	Each of them is under threat from sUAS and
drones which are used to surveil the bases by adversaries.
 	In early 2021, The Pentagon released a new strategy Jan. 7
to counter increasingly complex small drone threats.
 	AFWERX recognized the need for solutions to secure
airfield operations against the threats and hazards of small
UAS systems, stating there is a need for “leveraging
automation to strengthen the airfield perimeter
security”
 	With hundreds of bases and thousands of operational
sites active worldwide, the Air Force needs a low-cost, yet
highly effective solution for counteracting the threat of
intelligence collection by UAS and drone systems.', '[{"id":"9999cdaa-2a3c-4188-926f-b10ea025e4ff","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Significance of Problem and Opportunity\n5\nTopic: X23.5_CSO \tProposal Number: FX235-CSO1-0859\n“Base-Wide Counter-UAS and Defeat of Drone Surveillance Utilizing Innovative LED-Based Directed Energy System”\n \tThe Department of Defense has over 800 active duty bases\nworldwide. \tEach of them is under threat from sUAS and\ndrones which are used to surveil the bases by adversaries.\n \tIn early 2021, The Pentagon released a new strategy Jan. 7\nto counter increasingly complex small drone threats.\n \tAFWERX recognized the need for solutions to secure\nairfield operations against the threats and hazards of small\nUAS systems, stating there is a need for “leveraging\nautomation to strengthen the airfield perimeter\nsecurity”\n \tWith hundreds of bases and thousands of operational\nsites active worldwide, the Air Force needs a low-cost, yet\nhighly effective solution for counteracting the threat of\nintelligence collection by UAS and drone systems."},"history":[],"provenance":{"source":"imported"},"library_eligible":true}]'::jsonb, NULL, 142, 941, '{}'::jsonb, 'approved', 0.5, 'pending', 0.5, 0, 'upload', '31c0c32b-a7c5-47fc-817b-55a3b84f960f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, '686842de-ae88-44ac-b724-8e550f079e3e'::uuid, 'tenant', '2026-08-18T22:42:56.469Z'::timestamptz, '2026-08-18T22:42:56.469Z'::timestamptz, 'admin', uid, '[{"blockIds":["b11"],"sourceAtomId":"61cb1be6-93f1-4af6-9561-8b8fb5b5e554"}]'::jsonb, NULL)
