the HALAR-Laser solution to meet the Air Force’s c-UAS requirements and needs.
 	Desired Outcome: Development and fielding strategy, complete with Work Plan, for a USAF
variant of Immobileyes HALAR-Laser solution for integration into base defense architectures.
