Immobileyes and its partners have a long history of successfully commercializing innovation and developing
innovative and value-added products for customers. The company has a dedicated network of support
organizations which provide resources, guidance, and connections. Immobileyes have access to committed
venture and growth capital to allow for rapid growth and expansion upon validation of the solutions by the Air
Force. In summary, the company has a well thought out and developed commercialization strategy which it is
currently successfully executing.
