e to Overhead Costs? NO\nApply G&A Rate to Direct Labor Costs? YES\nApply G&A Rate to Direct Material Costs? YES\nApply G&A Rate to ODC- Travel? YES\nPlease specify the different cost sources below from which your company''s General and Administrative costs\nare calculated.\nThese are based off actual pooled rate calculations of existing employees and the costs of these activities.\nG&A Cost ($): $24,680.00\nSum of all G&A Costs is ($): $63,872.30\nODC-Materials\nBase"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"cbd1b725-503c-4d74-9bb4-5aa797d549fa","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"-- 25 of 32 --"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"24d1c560-dee8-4ce2-ae5f-4f61c06f1e5a","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Description: Initial Modeling, Analysis, and Testing Components Vendor: Alpha Micron\nQuantity: 1 Total Cost($): $8,000.00\nConsumable? yes Competitively Sourced? yes\nExclusive for this Contract? yes\nSupporting Comments:\nThis is an estimated costs for the components which will be used to model the effectiveness of the DEXTER capability against\nstandard drone EO-IR and fiber sensors and guidance systems. The costs are based off known components and all materials will be\nconsumed into the project deliverables.\nOption\nDescription: Components for DEXTER Benchtop System and Testing\nPrototype Vendor: AlphaMicron\nQuantity: 1 Total Cost($): $22,000.00\nConsumable? yes Competitively Sourced? yes\nExclusive for this Contract? yes\nSupporting Comments:\nThis is an estimated costs for the components which will be used to actually prototype the DEXTER benchtop system and test against\nstandard drone EO-IR and fiber sensors and guidance systems. The costs are based off known components and all materials will be\nconsumed into the project deliverables. This will provide the cost analysis for manufacturable systems in the Phase II and Phase III\nefforts.\nODC-Travel\nBase\nDescription: Recommended Phase I Onsite Meeting\nLocation From: Kent, Ohio Location To: Patuxent River, Maryland\nNumber of People: 2 Number of Days: 3\nPurpose of Trip:\nTravel is recommended for two (2) engineering personnel to travel from the contractor''s facility in Kent, OH to NAS Patuxent River,\nMD for critical system integration meetings and demonstrations.\nTotal Airfare Costs ($): $0.00 Total Car Rental Costs ($): $234.00\nTotal Per Diem Costs ($): $780.00 Total Other Costs ($): $130.00\nTotal Costs ($): $1,144.00\nSources of Estimates:"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"ed711c91-cfab-4149-b796-55ee77620c9a","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"GSA Per Diem Rates Search (Use ''Maryland'' and ''St. Mary''s County'' to verify current limits): https://www.gsa.gov/travel/plan-"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:44.228Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"14a9729e-8536-418c-ac01-58a77c22b753","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"book/per-diem-rates • Federal Travel Regulation (FTR) M&IE Breakdown (Shows the $68 full day and $51 travel day calculation):\nhttps://www.gsa.gov/travel/plan-book/per-diem-rates/mie-breakdown • Rental C