GSA/DTIC per-diem rates for St. Mary''s County, MD ($110/night for lodging and $68/day for M&IE, scaled to 75% for travel days).
Transportation assumes a 3-day intermediate SUV rental originating in Northeast Ohio (averaging $65/day based on current market
quotes) plus mileage/fuel. Driving is utilized as it represents the most economical method of transport to the Pax River installation
for two personnel traveling with equipment.
