/animal subjects or a recombinant DNA as described in DoDI\n3216.01, 32 C.F.R. Section 219, and National Institutes of Health Guidelines for Research Involving Recombinant DNA\nof the solicitation?\nNO\n13. Are teaming partners or subcontractors proposed? NO\n14. Are you proposing to use foreign nationals as defined in 22 CFR 120.16 for work under the proposed effort? NO\n15. What percentage of the principal investigators total time will be on the project? 25%\n16. Is the principal investigator socially/economically disadvantaged? NO\n17. Does your firm allow for the release of its contact information to Economic Development Organizations? YES"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:45.005Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:45.005Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"d1e57efe-561a-41ff-9521-bd43267a45f7","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"-- 6 of 7 --"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:45.005Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:45.005Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"dee2f9cb-b6eb-4fcc-b6c8-a739ec71b76c","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"VOL I - Contact Information\nPrincipal Investigator\nName: Dr. Atossa Alavi\nPhone: (330) 819-5157\nEmail: atossa@immobileyes.com\nAddress: 1950 State Route 59, Kent, OH 44240 - 4376\nCorporate Official\nName: Eric Wagner\nPhone: (614) 477-0303\nEmail: eric@immobileyes.com\nAddress: 1950 State Route 59, Kent, OH 44240 - 4376\nAuthorized Contract Negotiator\nName: Dr. Atossa Alavi\nPhone: (330) 819-5157\nEmail: atossa@immobileyes.com\nAddress: 1950 State Route 59, Kent, OH 44240 - 4376\nForm Generated on 07/22/2026 10:50:17 AM"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:4