  VALUES ('d27aac41-e9f9-4fc3-baf1-48dfe6267856'::uuid, tid, 'reference', 'N26BXNP0020450_Addt_Cost_Info_1816592.pdf', 'Travel Budget Justification – Per Solicitation Recommendations
One Meeting for the Base Period Onsite and One for the Option Period Onsite for two
Immobileyes employees traveling by car to NAVAIR.
Project: Guided Hostile Optical Sensor-hijacking (GHOST)
Proposal Topic / Volume: USN SBIR Submission - Travel Budget Travel Summary Origin: Kent, Ohio Destination: NAS Patuxent River / Lexington Park, MD (St. Mary''s County) Travelers: 2 Employees Duration: 3 Days, 2 Nights per trip Frequency: 2 Trips (1 in Fall, 1 in Spring) 2. Per-Diem & Transportation Cost Breakdown
GSA / DTIC Per-Diem Rates (St. Mary''s County, MD): Lodging Maximum: $110.00 per night. Meals & Incidental Expenses (M&IE): $68.00 per full day. Travel Day M&IE (First and Last Day): $51.00 per day (75% of standard rate). Per-Person Per-Diem Cost (Per Trip): Lodging: 2 nights × $110.00 = $220.00 M&IE: (2 travel days × $51.00) + (1 full day × $68.00) = $170.00 Total Per-Diem per person, per trip: $390.00 Transportation (Rental Car & Fuel):

Rental Car Estimate: 3 days × $65.00/day + 20% local taxes/fees = $234.00 per trip. Fuel Estimate: ~780 miles round trip at 25 MPG and $3.50/gallon = $110.00 per trip. 3. Consolidated Travel Budget
Trip 1: Fall Trip (3 Days, 2 Nights, 2 Travelers) Lodging: 2 rooms × 2 nights × $110/night = $440.00 M&IE: 2 people × $170/trip = $340.00 Rental Car (Intermediate SUV): $234.00 Fuel/Tolls: $130.00 Trip 1 Total: $1,144.00 Trip 2: Spring Trip (3 Days, 2 Nights, 2 Travelers) Lodging: 2 rooms × 2 nights × $110/night = $440.00 M&IE: 2 people × $170/trip = $340.00 Rental Car (Intermediate SUV): $234.00 -- 1 of 2 -- Fuel/Tolls: $130.00 Trip 2 Total: $1,144.00 Total Proposed Travel Budget: $2,288.00
4. Budget Narrative / Justification
"Travel is required for two (2) engineering personnel to travel from the contractor''s facility in
Kent, OH to NAS Patuxent River, MD for critical system integration meetings and
demonstrations. Two separate 3-day (2-night) trips are budgeted (one in the Fall, one in the
Spring). Costs are estimated using standard CONUS GSA/DTIC per-diem rates for St. Mary''s
County, MD ($110/night for lodging and $68/day for M&IE, scaled to 75% for travel days).
Transportation assumes a 3-day intermediate SUV rental originating in Northeast Ohio
(averaging $65/day based on current market quotes) plus mileage/fuel. Driving is utilized as
it represents the most economical method of transport to the Pax River installation for two
personnel traveling with equipment."
5. Reference Links

GSA Per Diem Rates Search (Use ''Maryland'' and ''St. Mary''s County'' to verify current limits):
https://www.gsa.gov/travel/plan-book/per-diem-rates Federal Travel Regulation (FTR) M&IE Breakdown (Shows the $68 full day and $51 travel day calculation):
https://www.gsa.gov/travel/plan-book/per-diem-rates/mie-breakdown Rental Car Estimation (Used for generic Cleveland/Akron market average SUV rates): https://www.expedia.com/Cars Defense Travel Management Office (DTMO) / DTIC Per Diem Guidelines: https://www.travel.dod.mil/Travel-Transportation-Rates/Per-Diem/

