ded and be aware that they supported the\nproposal in which their letter appeared.\n─ \tFabricated letters of support, or letters modified without the\nsignatory’s knowledge or consent, are false statements.\nDistribution A - Approved for Public Release | Office of Naval Research DCN #: 43-7334-20"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"41df0552-26b3-469f-a447-361a2a562809","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"-- 20 of 25 --"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"12e63d71-d67d-4bb2-80fe-13fe8a59884c","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"For reporting fraud via the qui tam provision of the False Claims Act,\nwhistleblowers can receive up to 30% of any judgment award.\nConsequences of\nCommitting\nFraud\nLying to Obtain an SBIR/STTR Contract or Lying about\nthe Work Performed"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"4ac49367-478a-4b7d-967f-127a0bd1eaef","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"Criminal Prosecution"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"8cc36e78-3ac0-4f27-9bf4-a5417da322bf","type":"text_block","style":{},"co