stleblowers can receive up to 30% of any judgment award.\nConsequences of\nCommitting\nFraud\nLying to Obtain an SBIR/STTR Contract or Lying about\nthe Work Performed"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"00b08f3e-9a95-439e-a30a-c03b5a7ab4f7","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"Civil Liability"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"4225b291-90a6-4320-b7ef-592e4813af73","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"─ \tTreble (3x) actual damages\n─ \tFine of up to $11,000 for each false claim (for example, payments\nreceived (1) when the Government relied upon false information in\nthe SBIR/STTR proposal, (2) in a certification of current cost or\npricing data, (3) in a request for payment or (4) in progress reports)\n─ \tCivil liability damages may be imposed in addition to criminal\nprosecution per Civil False Claims Act, 31 USC §§3729-3733\nDistribution A - Approved for Public Release | Office of Naval Research DCN #: 43-7334-20"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"16416f10-248a-4f6a-8e91-d839471db5a6","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"-- 22 of 25 --"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"9018c7e5-6f19-4e59-b7dd-815e0d55b26d","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Administrative Remedies\nIn addition to Criminal and Civil Liabilities, the\nGovernment \tcan \timplement \tadministrative\nremedies to:"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"1a908be8-bae8-40da-a7a2-5051df6be754","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"terminate contracts tainted by fraud."},{"text":"debar the related SBC, owner, and/or employees"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"af5e008f-465d-4847-a111-f24b88d3a6f3","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"from SBIR/STTR programs (typically for 3 years)."},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"0939726b-f2d2-4b9f-b5a2-d251fbcc4856","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"prohibit the relevant SBC from receiving any"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"5e532612-c08b-4046-80fc-4cbd82b8796a","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"federal contracts."},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"67325849-935d-4076-97e9-fd8da11af8f8","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"prohibit the relevant people from working as"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"e25c414b-0269-4a13-853e-1518125e0439","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"subcontractors on federal contracts.\nDistribution A - Approved for Public Release | Office of Naval Research DCN #: 43-7334-20"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"c6f296e4-b223-4645-9aed-0b80fa9bba57","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"-- 23 of 25 --"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"52d4337d-7d98-4080-ae7d-014000793ed5","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Quick Reference\nDO\n● \tInclude only truthful information in\nproposals re: company size, facilities,\npersonnel, consultants, subawards,\nsupporters, etc.\n● \tInclude only truthful certifications as to\neligibility requirements at each phase of\nthe award, from proposal to reports.\n● \tRead the applicable rules and follow\nthem. Certify on multiple occasions that\nyou have done so.\n● \tIf you have questions, ask the\nContracting Officer!\nDON’T\n● \tCertify to things you aren’t sure about\n(or know to be false).\n● \tMake up bios or publications for people\nin proposals.\n● \tPlagiarize, fabricate, or falsify text or\nfigures in proposals or reports.\n● \tDescribe in proposals facilities,\nequipment or employees that you don’t\nhave.\n● \tAlter or fabricate letters of support.\n● \tCreate fake accounting documents.\n● \tUse award funds for personal expenses\n(except for allowed profit and\nlegitimately earned salary).\nDistribution A - Approved for Public Release | Office of Naval Research DCN #: 43-7334-20"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"0fa7fbf7-9b33-4c2c-b0fe-256df2c26d90","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"-- 24 of 25 --"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"d6c741bc-71e7-4686-be7d-ec63c880e2da","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"Fraud, Waste, and Abuse\n(FWA) Summary\nThe Department of the Navy:"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"71b4a57f-d64e-4dc0-b510-34a8f4363540","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"Takes occurrences of FWA seriously."},{"text":"Continues efforts to prevent FWA."},{"text":"Hosts an SBIR/STTR FWA webpage to promote awareness"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"4d9bcf4b-ab02-4774-9faf-82ce79ad8ed2","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"here navysbir.com/fwa.htm."},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"605745f6-2932-4dcf-8d1d-2d02f1910805","type":"bulleted_list","style":{},"content":{"items":[{"text":"Provides \tan \tonline \tFraud, \tWaste, \tand \tAbuse \tTutorial \tto"}]},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"9d70f075-a1d7-4eee-b7fb-301dcb24e485","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"educate SBCs here navysbir.com/links_forms.htm.\nReport suspected or detected FWA to:\nwww.secnav.navy.mil/ig/Pages/ComplaintProcedure.asp\nor https://www.ncis.navy.mil/Resources/NCIS-Tips/\nDistribution A - Approved for Public Release | Office of Naval Research DCN #: 43-7334-20"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true},{"id":"5f4b4342-504f-4081-a657-69b3a08445ac","type":"text_block","style":{},"content":{"text":"-- 25 of 25 --"},"history":[{"action":"created","actor_id":"system:import","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","actor_name":"Document Import"}],"provenance":{"source":"imported","drafted_at":"2026-08-18T22:46:46.072Z","drafted_by":"system:import"},"library_eligible":true}]'::jsonb, 'Other supporting document (Volume 5 sidecar) · Uploaded pdf · 25 objects · N26BX-NP002 GHOST — Navy SBIR Phase I (DSIP package)', 2251, 14344, '{}'::jsonb, 'approved', 0.5, 'pending', 0.5, 0, 'upload', '684d8917-6a86-4eeb-806d-4db1cd3a655f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, '686842de-ae88-44ac-b724-8e550f079e3e'::uuid, 'tenant', '2026-08-18T22:46:46.076Z'::timestamptz, '2026-08-18T22:46:46.076Z'::timestamptz, 'admin', uid, NULL, NULL)
